-   - **f3_r (Right, Z-max):** `[v_idx[x,y,z], v_idx[x+1,y,z], v_idx[x+1,y+1,z], v_idx[x,y+1,z]]`
+6.  **Face Index Construction:** Extract the coordinates of the faces and map them to vertex indices.
+    *   Get coordinates for each face type:
+        ```python
