+    *   Map to vertex indices using `v_idx`.
+    *   Construct quad indices (4 vertices per face):
+        *   **f1_l (Left X):** `[v_idx[x,y,z], v_idx[x,y,z+1], v_idx[x,y+1,z+1], v_idx[x,y+1,z]]`
